<title>POLAND: BWR 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>BWR 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.25 vs    0.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.09 vs    0.69</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.83 vs    2.91</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.71 vs    6.55</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.63 vs    3.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    7.59 vs    5.73</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 39.22 vs   23.76</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	89.75 vs   55.54</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
